From: Guohan Lu <securely1g@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Bind the module version to its registered source commit

The source keeps its base module version at 0.0.20. Registry consumers use
0.0.20-<full source commit> so the module declaration identifies the exact
archive reviewed in sonic-build-infra PRs #56, #57 and #58. This local
registration patch changes only that declaration; it is not an upstream
source fix.

--- a/MODULE.bazel
+++ b/MODULE.bazel
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 # Keep bazel_compatibility in sync with sonic-buildimage's .bazelversion.
 module(
     name = "sonic-build-infra",
-    version = "0.0.20",
+    version = "0.0.20-68832c2aad42470f4c983ead4279468529122b79",
     bazel_compatibility = [
         ">=8.5.1",
         "<=8.5.1",
